From 7416de7b889c6795391b0d821cb521292455ffa4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:55:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): report review handoffs without completion claims
 [daveey]

Review requests may precede implementation, and queued review wakes become stale when review returns. Remove the completion clause in all locales and refresh review wakes at fold/drain time while retaining pending reviewer notices. Distinguish reviewer runs from resumed implementation; unknown newer replica run lanes remain unchanged.
---
